' Dependencies
Routes --> Middleware : "protected by"
Routes --> Controllers : "thin adapters"
Routes --> Processors : "direct calls"
Controllers --> Processors
Processors --> Services : "business logic"
Services --> Drivers : "abstractions"
Services --> DBDriver : "TypeORM DataSource"
Drivers --> "PostgreSQL / Redis / External APIs" : "I/O"

note right of Processors : All 45 processors use\nprivate constructor +\nstatic getInstance() singleton pattern
note right of Services : 122 services; many also singletons;\nlayered beneath processors
note right of Drivers : DBDriver factory returns driver\nby EDataSourceType; IAPIDriver impls\nsync external APIs into dra_* schemas

@enduml
